   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Narrating a sequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Ketika** means \"when\" and places an action in time. **Sebelum** expresses that an action happens before; **setelah itu** introduces the next step."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Condition",
     "texto": [
      "**Seandainya** presents a hypothetical situation: \"if it were..\". **Kalau** also introduces a condition and is common in everyday speech."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
